      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.92 (vs ₹7.19 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.92 (down from ₹7.19 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.09b (up 13% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹94.5m (down 34% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 8.6% (down from 15% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses.",
