      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-05-29T15:07:00.000Z",
      "title": "ABM Knowledgeware Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year Ended 31 March, 2026",
      "body": "ABM Knowledgeware Limited, at the board meeting held on 29 May, 2026 recommended Final Dividend at the rate of 25% i.e. INR 1.25/- per share for the Financial year ended 31 March, 2026. The said Dividend, if declared by the members at the ensuing Annual General Meeting, will be credited /dispatched within thirty days of the said meeting. Register of Members and the Share Transfer Books of the Company will remain closed from 24 July, 2026 to 30 July, 2026 (both days inclusive), for the purpose of Annual General Meeting and Dividend. The Dividend, if approved will be payable to those Equity Shareholders whose named registered as on 23 July, 2026 (Record Date).",
      "keyDevTypeId": "45",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
